  "answer": "Project Zenith is a Q3 2023 initiative led by Marcus Cole aimed at optimizing cloud storage solutions with enhanced security and accessibility, leveraging AI and machine learning. Key milestones include a kickoff on July 15th, a call for R&D ideas by July 20th, and initial findings in August showing a potential 20% efficiency increase. The project received a $2M executive budget and a $15,000 training budget. The team expanded by five members in September, with an onboarding session on September 10th. Security protocols were updated for multi-factor authentication and encryption, effective January next year. The project is exploring partnerships with TechInnovate and is currently seeking stakeholder feedback on the prototype by the end of November."
